[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0010","text":"…………\n呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0020","text":"真乃\n那件衣服，你喜欢吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0030","text":"……嗯……\n好缤纷多彩……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0040","text":"……\n感觉就像那天的便签一样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0050","text":"──啊，是整理文件时用的那些吧\n哈哈，确实……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0060","text":"……对、对不起……\n明明马上就要Live了，我却在说完全不相关的事………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0070","text":"没关系啊，这说明你游刃有余嘛\n真乃也是积累了经验，慢慢习惯了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0080","text":"哦，差不多该到开演时间了\n去吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0090","text":"是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0100","text":"……为了能让大家看到现在的我──\n我会竭尽全力……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101300_03_0102","text":"Motion"}]
